          },
          "author": "henkbirkholz",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "state": "APPROVED",
          "body": "I like the additional goals (and editorial on goal representation). The abstract now covers a small ref to VACR, which I like a lot (better than the clumsy references in the body). The introduction might require some more massaging, but with your proposed changes is good as is!\n\nI'll follow up with an editorial pass of \"on sentence per linebreak\" for easier to read diffs.",
